hlighting growing concerns about the treatment of foreign workers.  Several South Koreans were taken into custody, sparking debates over worker protections, labor rights, and the application of U. S.  immigration law."}],"$L13","$L14","$L15"]}],"$L16","$L17"]}]}],"$L18"]}]]}]}],"$L19"]}]}]]
